  "term": "HSI",
  "definition": "HSI stands for hamstring strain injuries, a common and often recurring sports injury involving the hamstring muscles. In this context, it is discussed in relation to measuring hamstring strength, fatigue after activity, and side-to-side strength differences that may relate to injury risk and monitoring.",
